@startuml
title Weather Station System State Machine

[*] --> Running

state Running
Running : entry / running state
Running : do / monitor weather conditions
Running : exit / continue running

Running --> ShutDown : shutdown command
Running --> ConfigMode : enter configuration mode
Running --> ControlledMode : remote control command
Running --> DataCollection : data collection triggered
Running --> SummaryPreparation : prepare summary
Running --> StatusChecking : check status

state ShutDown
ShutDown : entry / shutdown initiated
ShutDown : do / power down system
ShutDown --> [*] : shutdown complete

state ConfigMode
ConfigMode : entry / configuration mode
ConfigMode : do / adjust settings
ConfigMode --> Running : exit config mode

state ControlledMode
ControlledMode : entry / controlled mode
ControlledMode : do / respond to remote command
ControlledMode --> Running : exit controlled mode

state DataCollection
DataCollection : collect weather data
DataCollection --> Running : collection complete

state SummaryPreparation
SummaryPreparation : prepare weather summary
SummaryPreparation --> Running : summary ready

state StatusChecking
StatusChecking : check system status
StatusChecking --> Running : status checked
@enduml
